WEBVTT

00:06:58.476 --> 00:07:02.876
And those are the exact
same skills that we need

00:07:02.876 --> 00:07:04.916
to change the course of climate change.

00:07:05.636 --> 00:07:12.596
Now we need all of that X industry talent
to stop serving destruction

00:07:12.596 --> 00:07:14.396
and start serving solutions.

00:07:15.276 --> 00:07:17.476
And if you work in the X industry,

00:07:17.476 --> 00:07:20.836
you’re probably beginning to feel
a little bit uncomfortable right now.

00:07:21.316 --> 00:07:22.316
Good.

00:07:22.516 --> 00:07:23.636
(Laughter)

00:07:23.636 --> 00:07:26.436
(Applause)

00:07:26.516 --> 00:07:28.476
I want you to ask yourself:

00:07:28.476 --> 00:07:31.316
Are you selling your talent
to the right people?